Chains: T0.0 ~ T1.1 ~ T2.0 ~ T0.3!! (a0(T0) ~ a0(T1) ~ a0(T2) ~ c1(T0)). And T0.3 ~ T1.3 ~ T2.3 ~ T0.2 ~ T1.2 ~ T2.2 ~ T0.1 ~ T1.0 ~ T2.1 ~ T0.0. EVERYTHING is one class! V = 1. Let me verify: T0.0~T1.1 (a0~a0); T1.1~T2.0 (a0~a0); T2.0~T0.3 (a0~c1)!! So a0(T0) ~ c1(T0). And T0.3~T1.3; T1.3~T2.3; T2.3~T0.2 (c1~c0). So all four corners of T0 in one class → all corners: V = 1.

